<title>SPAIN: Baron de Ley final IPO for 74.6 pct of group.</title>
<headline>Baron de Ley final IPO for 74.6 pct of group.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish winery Baron de Ley, whose shares began to trade on Wednesday, said its total initial public offer would be for 74.6 percent of its capital.</p>
<p>Underwriters will exercise a &quot;green shoe&quot; option for 8.38 percent of the group's capital, bringing the total up to 74.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
